"],["(is) my account","ḥisābiyah"]],"69:27":[["O! I wish it","yālaytahā"],["had been","kānati"],["the end","l-qāḍiyata"]],"69:28":[["Not","mā"],["has availed","aghnā"],["me","ʿannī"],["my wealth","māliyah"]],"69:29":[["Is gone","halaka"],["from me","ʿannī"],["my authority","sul'ṭāniyah"]],"69:30":[["Seize him","khudhūhu"],["and shackle him","faghullūhu"]],"69:31":[["Then","thumma"],["(into) the Hellfire","l-jaḥīma"],["burn him","ṣallūhu"]],"69:32":[["Then","thumma"],["into","fī"],["a chain","sil'silatin"],["its length","dharʿuhā"],["(is) seventy","sabʿūna"],["cubits","dhirāʿan"],["insert him","fa-us'lukūhu"]],"69:33":[["Indeed, he","innahu"],["was","kāna"],["not","lā"],["believing","yu'minu"],["in Allah","bil-lahi"],["the Most Great","l-ʿaẓīmi"]],"69:34":[["And (did) not","walā"],["feel the urge","yaḥuḍḍu"],["on","ʿalā"],["(the) feeding","ṭaʿāmi"],["(of) the poor","l-mis'kīni"]],"69:35":[["So not","falaysa"],["for him","lahu"],["today","l-yawma"],["here","hāhunā"],["any devoted friend","ḥamīmun"]],"69:36":[["And not","walā"],["any food","ṭaʿāmun"],["except","illā"],["from","min"],["(the) discharge of wounds","ghis'līnin"]],"69:37":[["Not","lā"],["will eat it","yakuluhu"],["except","illā"],["the sinners","l-khāṭiūna"]],"69:38":[["But nay","falā"],["I swear","uq'simu"],["by what","bimā"],["you see","tub'ṣirūna"]],"69:39":[["And what","wamā"],["not","lā"],["you see","tub'ṣirūna"]],"69:40":[["Indeed, it (is)","innahu"],["surely (the) Word","laqawlu"],["(of) a Messenger","rasūlin"],["noble","karīmin"]],"69:41":[["And not","wamā"],["it","huwa"],["(is the) word","biqawli"],["(of) a poet","shāʿirin"],["little","qalīlan"],["(is) what","mā"],["you believe","tu'minūna"]],"69:42":[["And not","walā"],["(it is the) word","biqawli"],["(of) a soothsayer","kāhinin"],["little","qalīlan"],["(is) what","mā"],["you take heed","tadhakkarūna"]],"69:43":[["(It is) a revelation","tanzīlun"],["from","min"],["(the) Lord","rabbi"],["(of) the worlds","l-ʿālamīna"]],"69:44":[["And if","walaw"],["he (had) fabricated","taqawwala"],["against Us","ʿalaynā"],["some","baʿḍa"],["sayings","l-aqāwīli"]],"69:45":[["Certainly We (would) have seized","la-akhadhnā"],["him","min'hu"],["by the right hand","bil-yamīni"]],"69:46":[["Then","thumma"],["certainly We (would) have cut off","laqaṭaʿnā"],["from him","min'hu"],["the aorta","l-watīna"]],"69:47":[["And not","famā"],["from you","minkum"],["any","min"],["one","aḥadin"],["[from him]","ʿanhu"],["(who could) prevent (it)","ḥājizīna"]],"69:48":[["And indeed, it","wa-innahu"],["(is) surely a reminder","latadhkiratun"],["for the Allah-fearing","lil'muttaqīna"]],"69:49":[["And indeed, We","wa-innā"],["surely know","lanaʿlamu"],["that","anna"],["among you","minkum"],["(are) deniers","mukadhibīna"]],"69:50":[["And indeed, it","wa-innahu"],["(is) surely a regret","laḥasratun"],["upon","ʿalā"],["the disbelievers","l-kāfirīna"]],"69:51":[["And indeed, it (is)","wa-innahu"],["surely (the) truth","laḥaqqu"],["(of) certainty","l-yaqīni"]],"69:52":[["So glorify","fasabbiḥ"],["(the) name","bi-is'mi"],["(of) your Lord","rabbika"],["the Most Great","l-ʿaẓīmi"]]}